<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 10px; max-width: 500px; margin: auto; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #0984e3; letter-spacing: 5px; text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Reset Your Password 🔐</h2>
        <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>
        <p>Aapne password reset ki request ki hai. Neeche diya gaya OTP use karein (Ye 10 mins mein expire ho jayega):</p>
        
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>

        <p>Agar aapne ye request nahi ki, toh is email ko ignore karein.</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Note-App Support Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>